gline":"The mysterious Kilaaks appear! Shaking the universe, the great battle of 11 monsters!"},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"怪獣総進撃","overview":"ゴジラシリーズ第9作。２０世紀末、国連科学委員会は小笠原諸島のとある島に怪獣ランドを建設。ゴジラをはじめとする怪獣たちを一堂に集め、平和裏に管理していた。だが、怪獣ランドに謎の毒ガスが充満。その直後、怪獣ランドの怪獣たちは世界各地を襲撃し始めるのだった。国連科学委員会はキラアク星人の地球征服計画を突き止め、新鋭宇宙艇ムーンライトＳＹ－３を発進させ、月にあるキラアクの怪獣操縦装置の奪取に成功。地球怪獣連合の反撃が始まる。だがキラアク星人は地球にキングギドラを送り込み、形勢逆転を狙うが…。","tagline":"謎のキラアク星人出現！宇宙をゆるがす１１大怪獣の大激闘！"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iTTPDlbBwcEGMXrmjaAzj3YBQEe.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l4gfTsSZkVofKxzcqMCTBUkeHw8.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":3107,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iTTPDlbBwcEGMXrmjaAzj3YBQEe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iTTPDlbBwcEGMXrmjaAzj3YBQEe.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iTTPDlbBwcEGMXrmjaAzj3YBQEe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iTTPDlbBwcEGMXrmjaAzj3YBQEe.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/24r1hsRisfUidwLF67J0iMuWh7p.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/24r1hsRisfUidwLF67J0iMuWh7p.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/24r1hsRisfUidwLF67J0iMuWh7p.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/24r1hsRisfUidwLF67J0iMuWh7p.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vjJfB7yoqFz31pz3ZSiE4iSYZKz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vjJfB7yoqFz31pz3ZSiE4iSYZKz.jpg","language":"en","width":1078,"height":1617},{"type":"